WEBVTT

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:03.246
Open conversations about mental
illness help erode stigma

00:04:03.288 --> 00:04:05.621
and make it easier
for people to ask for help.

00:04:05.663 --> 00:04:07.746
And the more patients seek treatment,

00:04:07.788 --> 00:04:10.996
the more scientists will learn
about depression,

00:04:11.038 --> 00:04:13.663
and the better the treatments will get.